0033:     - Sort markers left-to-right when they share a row, or top-to-bottom when they share a column.
0034:     - For each sorted marker, make one copy of the template mask recolored to that marker color.
0035:     - Concatenate the copies horizontally for a marker row, or vertically for a marker column.
0036: 
0037:     Key insight
0038:     - The single pixels are an ordered palette; the larger foreground shape is a reusable stencil.
